{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Voice Activity Detection & Turn-Taking \u2014 Silero, Cobra, and the Flush Trick Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: the energy gate"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def energy_vad(chunk, threshold_dbfs=-40.0):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    rms = (sum(x * x for x in chunk) / len(chunk)) ** 0.5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    dbfs = 20.0 * math.log10(max(rms, 1e-10))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return dbfs > threshold_dbfs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: Silero VAD in Python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "from silero_vad import load_silero_vad, get_speech_timestamps"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "vad = load_silero_vad()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "audio = torch.tensor(waveform_16k, dtype=torch.float32)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "segments = get_speech_timestamps("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    audio, vad, sampling_rate=16000,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    threshold=0.5,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    min_speech_duration_ms=250,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    min_silence_duration_ms=500,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    speech_pad_ms=300,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "for s in segments:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"{s['start']/16000:.2f}s - {s['end']/16000:.2f}s\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: turn-end state machine"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class TurnDetector:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def __init__(self, silence_hangover_ms=500, min_speech_ms=250):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.state = \"idle\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.speech_ms = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.silence_ms = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.silence_hangover_ms = silence_hangover_ms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        self.min_speech_ms = min_speech_ms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    def update(self, is_speech, chunk_ms=20):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if is_speech:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            self.speech_ms += chunk_ms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            self.silence_ms = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if self.state == \"idle\" and self.speech_ms >= self.min_speech_ms:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                self.state = \"speaking\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                return \"START\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        else:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            self.silence_ms += chunk_ms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            if self.state == \"speaking\" and self.silence_ms >= self.silence_hangover_ms:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                self.state = \"idle\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                self.speech_ms = 0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                return \"END\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        return None"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: the flush trick skeleton"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def flush_on_end(stt_client, audio_buffer):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    stt_client.send_audio(audio_buffer)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    stt_client.send_flush()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return stt_client.recv_transcript(timeout_ms=150)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "STT (Kyutai, Deepgram, AssemblyAI) must support flush for this to work. Whisper streaming does not \u2014 it's block-based and always waits for chunks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. **Easy.** Run `code/main.py`. It simulates a speech + silence + speech + coughs sequence and tests three VAD tiers.\n2. **Medium.** Install `silero-vad`, process a 5-min recording, tune threshold to minimize both first-word clips and false triggers. Report precision/recall.\n3. **Hard.** Build a mini turn-detector: Silero VAD + a 3-layer MLP on the last 10 words' embeddings (use sentence-transformers). Train on a hand-labeled turn-end dataset. Beat Silero-only by 10% F1."
      ]
    }
